            <ArticleTitle>First Complete Genome Sequence of Genotype III Japanese Encephalitis Virus Isolated from a Stillborn Piglet in India.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01503-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01503-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report here the first complete genome of the Japanese encephalitis virus (JEV) genotype III strain JEV/SW/IVRI/395A/2014, isolated from stillborn piglets in India. It shares 99% identity with strain JaOArS982 and a few other strains from Japan.</AbstractText>
